1
00:00:00,238 --> 00:00:10,820
让我问问你关于 AI 和创造力的问题，因为我知道，艺术家
和他们所使用的工具之间的关系，已经发生了巨大的变化。
Let me ask you a bit about AI and creativity because I think you know we we've already
seen so much change in the way that sort of the the artist and their tools, as it were.

2
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,600
