And I think we're seeing some of that again with AI, right?

12
00:01:19,694 --> 00:01:33,412
这就是所谓的「AI 垃圾内容」，也就是那种在创意上平淡无奇、毫无趣味的东西，
但它存在只是为了吸引观众关注几秒钟。
So there's this notion of AI slop, which is just sort of, you know, kind of fairly creatively mundane or not interesting creatively,
but it's there to kind of you know, hook an audience for a few seconds.

13
00:01:33,678 --> 00:01:40,516
我认为我们并不真的想往那个方向发展，理想情况下是这样，虽然，你知道，
如果只是轻量级的娱乐，或许也没关系。
And I think we don't really want to be going in that direction, ideally,
although, you know, it's maybe it's fine, it's kind of light entertainment.

14
00:01:41,038 --> 00:01:47,440
