But then on the other side of the ledger, you've got amazing tools that you could use for prototyping.

15
00:01:47,726 --> 00:02:00,960
所以我看到优秀的艺术家们现在可以尝试更多创意并进行早期测试，在投入大量资源之前，
找到他们真正想要支持或投入其中的那个想法。
So what I've seen great artists do is now they can go through, iterate through many more ideas and test them out early and before
committing too many resources to find the idea that they really want to back or commit to.

16
00:02:01,230 --> 00:02:04,720
我认为这对那些已经在领域顶尖的人来说非常棒。
So I think that's great for the people already at the top of their game.

17
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:07,012
他们很喜欢这个方面的功能。
