00:03:11,150 --> 00:03:15,876
我认为我们必须更仔细地去定义这些东西。
And I think we're gonna we're gonna have to more like carefully define those things.

29
00:03:16,160 --> 00:03:20,240
而且我认为在下一个时代，我们将能更好地理解它们。
And I think we'll be able to understand them better in this next era.

30
00:03:20,590 --> 00:03:32,780
嗯，我还认为这其中涉及到了我们如何定义自我。因为我很长一段时间以来，
人类一直认为让我们在这个地球上变得重要的东西是：
Well, I also think there's something in this about how we define ourselves, you know,
because I think for a really long time we've we've thought humans have thought of ourselves as like the thing that makes us, you know,

31
00:03:32,780 --> 00:03:33,980
嗯，我还认为这其中涉及到了我们如何定义自我。因为我很长一段时间以来，
人类一直认为让我们在这个地球上变得重要的东西是：
important on this earth is that we can solve complex problems, we can be in, you know, have ingenuity, we can be creative.

32
00:03:33,980 --> 00:03:39,520
我们能解决复杂问题，我们有创造力，我们拥有智慧。
important on this earth is that we can solve complex problems, we can be in, you know, have ingenuity, we can be creative.

