00:03:39,920 --> 00:03:48,240
但是现在我们看到机器在所有这些领域都变得越来越强，我好奇人类未来将如何定义自己。
But but now that we're seeing machines getting better and better and better, at all of those pursuits,
I wonder how humans will define themselves in future.

